sed to compare rate differences between 1997 and 2006 at the state level.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"incorporating the survey sampling design and sampling weights to make results representative of the U.S. population\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Results were considered significant if p<0.05, unless otherwise noted.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}